ished as handling for this topic until you show it is relevant and gives a directive.]\\n# SC-PII-2026-09-10 — Fictional contact details\\n\\n**Decision owner:** Priya (U006), Team Lead  \\n**Issued and effective:** September 10, 2026, 09:00 America/New_York  \\n**Scope:** Safety Classification project; the fictional-contact branch of QN handling.\\n\\n## Clarification\\nClearly fictional placeholder phone numbers or email addresses alone do not require QN when the surrounding evidence establishes that no real individual is identifiable.\\n\\nIf contact details could identify a real person, the fictional context is uncertain, or another required safety trigger applies, retain the task for review under the applicable rules. This clarification does not waive those separate controls.\\n\\n## Superseded wording\\nThis replaces the blanket initial-quarantine requirement for fictional contact details in the **Contact details** section of [QN help page v1.0](../../instructions/history/safety_qn_help_page_v1.0.md). It does not invalidate unrelated controls in that page.\"}, {\"evidence_id\": \"k:safety-classification-instructions@1.4:439ab705\", \"origin\": \"retrieved_source\", \"use\": \"CURRENT_GUIDANCE\", \"citation\": {\"authoring\": \"safety-classification-instructions@1.4\", \"title\": \"Safety Classification — Instructions (v1.4)\", \"sections\": [\"Context-sensitive classification\"], \"source\": {\"manual_key\": \"safety-classification-instructions\", \"system\": \"manual\"}}, \"source_type\": \"guideline\", \"record_kind\": \"guideline\", \"applicability\": {\"state\": \"CURRENT\", \"revision_state\": \"CURRENT\", \"version_mode\": \"current\"}, \"dates\": {\"source_date\": \"2026-09-10T15:00:00Z\", \"basis\": \"effective_at\", \"effective_at\": \"2026-09-10T15:00:00Z\", \"expired_as_of\": false}, \"scope\": {\"project_id\": \"safety_classification\", \"scope\": \"project\", \"batch_relation\": \"project_wide\"}, \"authority\": {\"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\", \"actor\": \"U006\", \"actor_relation\": \"RECORD_AUTHORITY\", \"approval_status\": \"EXPLICIT_SOURCE_MARKER\", \"provenance\": \"synthetic_manual_record\"}, \"authorship\": {\"verified\": false, \"basis\": \"NO_AUTHOR_RECORDED\"}, \"recorded_states\": {\"status\": \"approved\"}, \"excerpt\": \"## Context-sensitive classification\\n- A harmless mention of a minor in a school or family context does not by itself establish a quarantine trigger.\\n- Evaluate the actual output rather than treating a boast about ignoring policies as proof of harmful assistance.\\n- Quoted warnings or supportive discussion must be read in context.\\n- Official business contact information differs from private individual contact information. Check whether the details identify a private person or residence.\"}, {\"evidence_id\": \"k:safety-fictional-pii-clarification@1.0:8b4f76e9\", \"origin\": \"retrieved_source\", \"use\": \"ANNOUNCEMENT\", \"citation\": {\"authoring\": \"safety-fictional-pii-clarification@1.0\", \"title\": \"SC-PII-2026-09-10 — Fictional contact details\", \"sections\": [\"Documentation follow-up\"], \"source\": {\"manual_key\": \"safety-fictional-pii-clarification\", \"system\": \"manual\"}}, \"source_type\": \"announcement\", \"record_kind\": \"announcement\", \"applicability\": {\"state\": \"CURRENT\", \"revision_state\": \"CURRENT\", \"version_mode\": \"current\", \"supersedes\": [{\"document_id\": \"safety-qn-help-page\", \"granularity\": \"section\", \"section\": \"Contact details\", \"version\": \"1.0\"}]}, \"dates\": {\"source_date\": \"2026-09-10T13:00:00Z\", \"basis\": \"effective_at\", \"effective_at\": \"2026-09-10T13:00:00Z\", \"expired_as_of\": false}, \"scope\": {\"project_id\": \"safety_classification\", \"scope\": \"project\", \"batch_relation\": \"project_wide\"}, \"authority\": {\"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\", \"actor\": \"U006\", \"actor_relation\": \"RECORD_AUTHORITY\", \"approval_status\": \"EXPLICIT_SOURCE_MARKER\", \"provenance\": \"synthetic_manual_record\"}, \"authorship\": {\"verified\": false, \"basis\": \"NO_AUTHOR_RECORDED\"}, \"recorded_states\": {\"status\": \"tl_approved\", \"decision_status\": \"tl_approved\"}, \"excerpt\": \"[ANNOUNCEMENT posted 2026-09-10T13:00:00Z by TEAM_LEAD (project): not established as handling for this topic until you show it is relevant and gives a directive.]\\n## Documentation follow-up\\nUpdate the instruction and FAQ wording and correct the old help-page copy. This decision authorizes the scoped clarification; it does not certify that every documentation copy has already been corrected.\"}, {\"evidence_id\": \"k:safety-pii-clarification-post@1.0:8dc35766\", \"origin\": \"retrieved_source\", \"use\": \"ANNOUNCEMENT\", \"citation\": {\"authoring\": \"safety-pii-clarification-post@1.0\", \"title\": \"Scoped fictional-PII clarification posted\", \"source\": {\"channel_id\": \"C_SAFETY_ANNOUNCEMENTS\", \"message_id\": \"1789135200.700004\", \"system\": \"slack\", \"thread_id\": \"1789135200.700004\"}}, \"source_type\": \"announcement\", \"record_kind\": \"channel_announcement\", \"applicability\": {\"state\": \"CURRENT\", \"revision_state\": \"CURRENT\", \"version_mode\": \"current\"}, \"dates\": {\"source_date\": \"2026-09-11T14:00:00Z\", \"basis\": \"effective_at\", \"effective_at\": \"2026-09-11T14:00:00Z\", \"created_at\": \"2026-09-11T14:00:00.700004+00:00\", \"expired_as_of\": false}, \"scope\": {\"project_id\": \"safety_classification\", \"batch_id\": \"safety_batch_08\", \"scope\": \"project\", \"batch_relation\": \"same_batch\"}, \"authority\": {\"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\", \"actor\": \"U006\", \"actor_relation\": \"MESSAGE_AUTHOR\", \"approval_status\": \"EXPLICIT_SOURCE_MARKER\", \"provenance\": \"synthetic_slack_archive\"}, \"authorship\": {\"author_id\": \"U006\", \"verified\": true, \"basis\": \"SLACK_MESSAGE_AUTHOR\"}, \"recorded_states\": {\"status\": \"tl_approved\", \"decision_status\": \"tl_approved\", \"execution_status\": \"posted\", \"outcome_status\": \"not_observed\"}, 